WEBVTT

00:06:29.411 --> 00:06:31.576
find your passion.

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:34.256
Don't let this extraordinary moment pass.

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:39.076
Together, we can ensure
that this will mark the beginning

00:06:39.100 --> 00:06:42.922
of a healthy, just
and sustainable future for all.